## Usage example

```bash
helm repo add stevenjdh https://StevenJDH.github.io/helm-charts
helm repo update
helm upgrade --install my-{{ template "chart.name" . }} stevenjdh/{{ template "chart.name" . }} --version {{ template "chart.version" . }} \
    --namespace example \
    --create-namespace \
    --atomic
```

> [!TIP]
> For information on how to get started, see the [Operator Guide](https://www.keycloak.org/guides#operator). Also, a full list of property references supported by the Keycloak Operator CRDs can be found under the [docs/crds](./docs/crds) folder. Currently, there are no official lists yet available, so these have been generated for convenience.

